## **How to be a part of MERLETS?**

We always welcome new members!&nbsp;If you are ready, click on [THIS FORM](https://forms.gle/NDCWTAtu261E1iTm7) and fill out your details. If you prefer to do it the old school way, please download, print out the [2025 MERLETS Brochure](/2025-MERLETS-Brochure.pdf)  and send it to our email.

Once you submit it, one of our members will get in touch with you to confirm!

If you have any questions or concerns please do not hesitate to call Marilyn on 0424 008 482.

[Fill out this form online](https://forms.gle/NDCWTAtu261E1iTm7)

[Download the 2025 MERLETS Brochure](/2025-MERLETS-Brochure.pdf)

